-- title:
--   Original BV signed physical Fatou grid estimates imply the full closed Stieltjes cash budget
-- statement:
--   For an actual original bounded-variation Lévy risk process with an admissible dividend strategy, any physical finite-grid family of nonnegative integrable rewards, signed integrable nonpositive-mean drift and compensator witnesses, pathwise cash upper bounds, and a strict-horizon ENNReal Fatou liminf condition yields the complete closed-horizon discounted Stieltjes dividend budget. Includes the time-zero and horizon atoms and the true original ruin clock. Existence of these stochastic witnesses remains a separate explicit source obligation.
-- source:
--   Composes Proved c9cd826c (original vanishing-error signed grid to actual strict prebudget) with Proved d0abbeb5 (original strict expected budget to inclusive Stieltjes cash). These are distinct dependencies with verified original-process statements.

import Mathlib
import Definitions.Def_AvramDividend_Classical_SpectrallyNegativeLevy
import Definitions.Def_AvramDividend_Classical_DividendStrategy
open MeasureTheory Set Filter AvramDividend.Classical
